  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:400px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-deepskyblue pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Absorption Mode</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/b/ba/One_Piece_Caribou_Numa_Numa_no_Mi_Absorb_Mermaids.gif/revision/latest?cb=20240619120017\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"One Piece Caribou Numa Numa no Mi Absorb Mermaids\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/b/ba/One_Piece_Caribou_Numa_Numa_no_Mi_Absorb_Mermaids.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20240619120017\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/b/ba/One_Piece_Caribou_Numa_Numa_no_Mi_Absorb_Mermaids.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20240619120017 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/b/ba/One_Piece_Caribou_Numa_Numa_no_Mi_Absorb_Mermaids.gif/revision/latest?cb=20240619120017 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"One Piece Caribou Numa Numa no Mi Absorb Mermaids\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"One_Piece_Caribou_Numa_Numa_no_Mi_Absorb_Mermaids.gif\" data-image-name=\"One Piece Caribou Numa Numa no Mi Absorb Mermaids.gif\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Caribou (One Piece) can use his Numa Numa no Mi/Swamp-Swamp Fruit powers to take on a swampy form to absorb various targets, like people, into his body.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Enter a state of being with traits and abilities related to absorption/absorption power.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The power to <b>enter a state of being with traits and abilities related to absorption/absorption power</b>. Technique of <a href=\"/wiki/Fanon:Absorption_Element_Manipulation\" title=\"Fanon:Absorption Element Manipulation\">Absorption Element Manipulation</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Absorption Energy Manipulation\">Absorption Energy Manipulation</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Manipulation\" title=\"Absorption Manipulation\">Absorption Manipulation</a>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Mode_Switching\" title=\"Mode Switching\">Mode Switching</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Videos\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Videos</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsorption_Mode%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Absorption Form</li>\n<li>Assimilation/Assimilative Form/Mode</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsorption_Mode%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can <a href=\"/wiki/Mode_Switching\" title=\"Mode Switching\">enter a state of being</a> with traits and abilities related to <a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Manipulation\" title=\"Absorption Manipulation\">absorption</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Fanon:Absorption_Element_Manipulation\" title=\"Fanon:Absorption Element Manipulation\">absorption power</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsorption_Mode%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Manipulation\" title=\"Absorption Manipulation\">Absorption Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Absorption_Manipulation\" title=\"Personal Absorption Manipulation\">Personal Absorption Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Arts\" title=\"Absorption Arts\">Absorption Arts</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Constructs\" title=\"Absorption Constructs\">Absorption Constructs</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Fanon:Absorption_Element_Manipulation\" title=\"Fanon:Absorption Element Manipulation\">Absorption Element Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Absorption Energy Manipulation\">Absorption Energy Manipulation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Empowerment\" title=\"Absorption Empowerment\">Absorption Empowerment</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Infusion\" title=\"Absorption Infusion\">Absorption Infusion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_Absorption\" title=\"Absolute Absorption\">Absolute Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Assimilation_Immunity\" title=\"Assimilation Immunity\">Assimilation Immunity</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Mode\" title=\"Personal Mode\">Personal Mode</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Mode_Borrowing\" title=\"Mode Borrowing\">Mode Borrowing</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Mode_Lock\" title=\"Mode Lock\">Mode Lock</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsorption_Mode%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Mode_Switching\" title=\"Mode Switching\">Mode Switching</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Conceptual_Mode\" title=\"Conceptual Mode\">Conceptual Mode</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Conditional_Mode\" title=\"Conditional Mode\">Conditional Mode</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Phenomenon_Mode\" title=\"Phenomenon Mode\">Phenomenon Mode</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Transformation\" title=\"Transformation\">Transformation</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsorption_Mode%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Users may require learning to control this state and its aspects at will.</li>\n<li>Users may require specific conditions to access or maintain this state.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Negation\" title=\"Absorption Negation\">Absorption Negation</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Anti_Storage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Anti Storage\">Anti Storage</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Mode_Manipulation\" title=\"Mode Manipulation\">Mode Manipulation</a></li>\n<li>Mode may only enable access to specific type of absorption ability (physical assimilation, remote extraction, etc.).</li>\n<li>May only be able to absorb certain targets (organic beings, energy, information, etc.).</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsorption_Mode%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"scrollable\" style=\"overflow:auto; max-height:275px; width:100%; -moz-border-radius-topleft:0.5em; border:1px solid #AAAAAA; padding-left:0.5em; background:transparent;\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://archiesonic.fandom.com/wiki/Titan_Tails\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:archiesonic:Titan Tails\">Titan Tails</a> (<i>Archie's Sonic the Hedgehog</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://ben10.fandom.com/wiki/Category:Omnitrix\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:ben10:Category:Omnitrix\">Omnitrix/Derivatives</a> Users (<i>Ben 10</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://blackclover.fandom.com/wiki/Lolopechka\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:blackclover:Lolopechka\">Lolopechka</a> (<i>Black Clover</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://blackclover.fandom.com/wiki/Charmy_Pappitson\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:blackclover:Charmy Pappitson\">Charmy Pappitson</a> (<i>Black Clover</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://bleach.fandom.com/wiki/Yumichika_Ayasegawa\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:bleach:Yumichika Ayasegawa\">Yumichika Ayasegawa</a> (<i>Bleach</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://bleach.fandom.com/wiki/J%C5%ABshir%C5%8D_Ukitake\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:bleach:Jūshirō Ukitake\">Jūshirō Ukitake</a> (<i>Bleach</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://chaoslegion.fandom.com/wiki/Sieg_Wahrheit_(game)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:chaoslegion:Sieg Wahrheit (game)\">Sieg Wahrheit</a> (<i>Chaos Legion</i>); via <a href=\"https://chaoslegion.fandom.com/wiki/Arrogance\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:chaoslegion:Arrogance\">Shield Legion – Arrorgance</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://classofthetitans.fandom.com/wiki/Theresa\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:classofthetitans:Theresa\">Theresa</a> (<i>Class of the Titans</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://dannyphantom.fandom.com/wiki/Half-ghost\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:dannyphantom:Half-ghost\">Half-ghosts</a> (<i>Danny Phantom</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://dc.fandom.com/wiki/Lantern_Corps\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:dc:Lantern Corps\">Lantern Corps</a> (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://finalfantasy.fandom.com/wiki/Psychic\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:finalfantasy:Psychic\">Psychic Dressphere</a> Users (<i>Final Fantasy X-2</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://hunterxhunter.fandom.com/wiki/Kurapika\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:hunterxhunter:Kurapika\">Kurapika</a> (<i>Hunter x Hunter</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://hunterxhunter.fandom.com/wiki/Chrollo_Lucilfer\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:hunterxhunter:Chrollo Lucilfer\">Chrollo Lucilfer</a> (<i>Hunter x Hunter</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://zatchbell.fandom.com/wiki/Wiseman_and_Kotoha\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:zatchbell:Wiseman and Kotoha\">Wiseman</a> (<i>Konjiki no Gash Bell!/Zatch Bell!</i>); via <a href=\"https://zatchbell.fandom.com/wiki/White_Spellbook\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:zatchbell:White Spellbook\">White Spellbook</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://marvelcinematicuniverse.fandom.com/wiki/Panther_Habit\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:marvelcinematicuniverse:Panther Habit\">Panther Habit</a> Users (<i>Marvel Cinematic Universe/Black Panther</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://marvel.fandom.com/wiki/Carl_Creel_(Earth-616)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:marvel:Carl Creel (Earth-616)\">Carl Creel/Absorbing Man</a> (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://myheroacademia.fandom.com/wiki/Taishiro_Toyomitsu\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:myheroacademia:Taishiro Toyomitsu\">Taishiro Toyomitsu/BMI Hero: Fatgum</a> (<i>My Hero Academia</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://naruto.fandom.com/wiki/Rinnegan\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:naruto:Rinnegan\">Rinnegan</a> Users (<i>Naruto</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://ok-ko.fandom.com/wiki/Kaio_Kincaid\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:ok-ko:Kaio Kincaid\">Kaio Kincaid/K.O.</a> (<i>OK K.O.! Let’s Be Heroes</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://onepiece.fandom.com/wiki/Aramaki\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:onepiece:Aramaki\">Aramaki/Ryokugyu</a> (<i>One Piece</i>); via <a href=\"https://onepiece.fandom.com/wiki/Mori_Mori_no_Mi\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:onepiece:Mori Mori no Mi\">Mori Mori no Mi/Woods-Woods Fruit</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://onepiece.fandom.com/wiki/Caribou\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:onepiece:Caribou\">Caribou</a> (<i>One Piece</i>); via <a href=\"https://onepiece.fandom.com/wiki/Numa_Numa_no_Mi\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:onepiece:Numa Numa no Mi\">Numa Numa no Mi/Swamp-Swamp Fruit</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://scryed.fandom.com/wiki/Kazuma_Torisuna\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:scryed:Kazuma Torisuna\">Kazuma Torisuna</a> (<i>S-CRY-ed</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://tekken.fandom.com/wiki/Jin_Kazama\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:tekken:Jin Kazama\">Jin Kazama</a> (<i>Tekken</i>); via <a href=\"https://tekken.fandom.com/wiki/Devil_Jin\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:tekken:Devil Jin\">Devil Jin</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsorption_Mode%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D7&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"5b0ac60ec66b1306bc1d4a66c823a6cf\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:202px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"hei